Adjudicates four generative streams (G1/OPGAPS, G2/REVERSAL, G3/NOTATION,
G4/ARROW) against their four adversarial verifiers, and re-measures the ten
claims that decide a build-vs-reject ruling rather than relaying them.

Three findings had no owning stream, because each verifier saw only one:

  * G1's `conjugacy_census` and G2's `commuting_probability` are the SAME op
    with two calling conventions. Merged; building both would have shipped
    duplicate registry surface.
  * G2's two census ops take REQUIRED callables. Measured over all 649
    ToolEntries: 12 callable params ship, ALL optional, and the contract says
    verbatim "a callable cannot cross JSON-RPC ... over the wire the only legal
    value is absence". Both must take a Cayley table — which is G1's
    representation, so the censuses now eat the same carrier.
  * No single branch held all eight streams. This commit collects them.

Re-measured, with a negative control on each:
  S2  moufang_residue already gives per-triple resolution — 1176/4096 nonzero
      at dim 16 vs one bit from is_moufang. law_census narrows to 8 laws.
  S3  unit_loop AND loop_invariants both lack `table=`; the gap is a pair.
  S5  the two dihedral conventions are ISOMORPHIC (576/576 via x -> x^-1);
      the 360-cell diff is order^2 - commuting. Control: identity map fails.
  S6  the 24-image T/I orbit partition EQUALS prime_form's — 79 blocks on both
      conventions; rotations-only gives 128, so the control separates.
  S7  breaking the anti-automorphism law splits the forward/chiral sets by 12
      each way, confirming G2's lead measurement was entailed, not measured.

My own three defects are recorded in §7 D rather than hidden — including a
first S6 instrument that returned 1507/1507 on both arms and so could not
return otherwise.

Verdict: a six-to-eight op arithmetic rc. All four G3 notation ops rejected.
Registry 649 -> 656 projected; 17 ripple surfaces named, and the one gate that
catches a lying `returns=` is CI-only.

READ-ONLY: no version bump, no package source touched, no PR, not pushed.

