+### 3.1 The split
+
+| Lane | Meaning | Shipped ops in it |
+|---|---|---|
+| **CARRIER** | The interval object itself. No modulus baked in, or the modulus is a parameter. | `just_limit` (ℚ⁺, no modulus); `comma_of_chain`, `tempers_out` (carrier-parametric) |
